    "body": "<header>\n<h1 data-aid=\"128477144\" id=\"title1\"><strong>Jesus Christ, Appearances, Postmortal</strong></h1>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128477145\" id=\"title2\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/god-manifestations-of?lang=eng\">God, Manifestations of</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/jesus-christ-appearances-antemortal?lang=eng\">Jesus Christ, Appearances, Antemortal</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477146\" id=\"p1\">Jesus <span class=\"key-word\">met</span> them, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/28?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">Matt. 28:9</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477147\" id=\"p2\">Jesus <span class=\"key-word\">came</span> and spake, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/28?lang=eng&amp;id=p18#p18\">Matt. 28:18</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477148\" id=\"p3\">when Jesus was risen … he <span class=\"key-word\">appeared</span> first to Mary, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/16?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">Mark 16:9</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477149\" id=\"p4\">Jesus himself drew <span class=\"key-word\">near</span>, and went with them, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/24?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">Luke 24:15</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477150\" id=\"p5\">Lord is risen indeed, and hath <span class=\"key-word\">appeared</span> to Simon, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/24?lang=eng&amp;id=p34#p34\">Luke 24:34</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477151\" id=\"p6\">Jesus himself <span class=\"key-word\">stood</span> in the midst, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/24?lang=eng&amp;id=p36#p36\">Luke 24:36</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/20?lang=eng&amp;id=p19#p19\">John 20:19</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477152\" id=\"p7\">spirit hath not <span class=\"key-word\">flesh</span> and bones, as ye see me have, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/24?lang=eng&amp;id=p39#p39\">Luke 24:39</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477153\" id=\"p8\">she turned … and <span class=\"key-word\">saw</span> Jesus standing, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/20?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">John 20:14</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477154\" id=\"p9\">glad, when they <span class=\"key-word\">saw</span> the Lord, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/20?lang=eng&amp;id=p20#p20\">John 20:20</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477155\" id=\"p10\">because thou hast <span class=\"key-word\">seen</span> me, thou hast believed, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/20?lang=eng&amp;id=p29#p29\">John 20:29</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477156\" id=\"p11\">Jesus <span class=\"key-word\">stood</span> on the shore, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/21?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">John 21:4</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477157\" id=\"p12\">third time that Jesus <span class=\"key-word\">shewed</span> himself, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/21?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">John 21:14</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477158\" id=\"p13\">he <span class=\"key-word\">shewed</span> himself alive after his passion, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">Acts 1:3</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477159\" id=\"p14\"><span class=\"key-word\">saw</span> … Jesus standing on the right hand of God, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/7?lang=eng&amp;id=p55#p55\">Acts 7:55</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477160\" id=\"p15\">I am <span class=\"key-word\">Jesus</span> whom thou persecutest, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">Acts 9:5</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477161\" id=\"p16\">Ananias … to him said the Lord in a <span class=\"key-word\">vision</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">Acts 9:10</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477162\" id=\"p17\">he had <span class=\"key-word\">seen</span> the Lord in the way, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p27#p27\">Acts 9:27</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477163\" id=\"p18\">God raised up the third day, and <span class=\"key-word\">shewed</span> him openly, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/10?lang=eng&amp;id=p40#p40\">Acts 10:40</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477164\" id=\"p19\">he was <span class=\"key-word\">seen</span> many days of them, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/13?lang=eng&amp;id=p31#p31\">Acts 13:31</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477166\" id=\"p20\">spake the Lord to Paul in the night by a <span class=\"key-word\">vision</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">Acts 18:9</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477167\" id=\"p21\"><span class=\"key-word\">saw</span> him saying unto me, Make haste, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/22?lang=eng&amp;id=p18#p18\">Acts 22:18</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477168\" id=\"p22\">night following the Lord <span class=\"key-word\">stood</span> by … Paul, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/23?lang=eng&amp;id=p11#p11\">Acts 23:11</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477169\" id=\"p23\">I have <span class=\"key-word\">appeared</span> unto thee, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/26?lang=eng&amp;id=p16#p16\">Acts 26:16</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477170\" id=\"p24\">he was <span class=\"key-word\">seen</span> of Cephas, then of the twelve, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-cor/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">1 Cor. 15:5</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477171\" id=\"p25\">he was <span class=\"key-word\">seen</span> of above five hundred brethren, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-cor/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">1 Cor. 15:6</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477172\" id=\"p26\">last of all he was <span class=\"key-word\">seen</span> of me, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-cor/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p8#p8\">1 Cor. 15:8</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477173\" id=\"p27\">I am <span class=\"key-word\">Jesus Christ</span> the Son of God, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">3 Ne. 9:15</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477174\" id=\"p28\"><span class=\"key-word\">saw</span> a Man descending out of heaven, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/11?lang=eng&amp;id=p8#p8\">3 Ne. 11:8</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477175\" id=\"p29\">did <span class=\"key-word\">see</span> with their eyes and did feel with their hands, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/11?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">3 Ne. 11:15</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p25#p25\">18:25</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477176\" id=\"p30\">multitude did <span class=\"key-word\">see</span> and hear, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/17?lang=eng&amp;id=p25#p25\">3 Ne. 17:25</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477177\" id=\"p31\">Jesus came and <span class=\"key-word\">stood</span> in the midst, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/19?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">3 Ne. 19:15</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477178\" id=\"p32\">Jesus again <span class=\"key-word\">showed</span> himself, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/27?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">3 Ne. 27:2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477179\" id=\"p33\">I was <span class=\"key-word\">visited</span> of the Lord, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/morm/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">Morm. 1:15</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477180\" id=\"p34\">I have <span class=\"key-word\">seen</span> Jesus, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/ether/12?lang=eng&amp;id=p39#p39\">Ether 12:39</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477181\" id=\"p35\"><span class=\"key-word\">Behold</span> the wounds which pierced my side, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/6?lang=eng&amp;id=p37#p37\">D&amp;C 6:37</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477182\" id=\"p36\">I am he who was <span class=\"key-word\">lifted</span> up, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/45?lang=eng&amp;id=p52#p52\">D&amp;C 45:52</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477183\" id=\"p37\">you shall <span class=\"key-word\">see</span> me and know that I am, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/67?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">D&amp;C 67:10</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477184\" id=\"p38\">we <span class=\"key-word\">saw</span> him, even on the right hand of God, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/76?lang=eng&amp;id=p23#p23\">D&amp;C 76:23</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477185\" id=\"p39\">every soul who forsaketh his sins … shall <span class=\"key-word\">see</span> my face, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/93?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">D&amp;C 93:1</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477186\" id=\"p40\">We <span class=\"key-word\">saw</span> the Lord standing upon the breastwork, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/110?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">D&amp;C 110:2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477187\" id=\"p41\">I will <span class=\"key-word\">appear</span> unto my servants, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/110?lang=eng&amp;id=p8#p8\">D&amp;C 110:8</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477188\" id=\"p42\">When the Savior shall <span class=\"key-word\">appear</span> we shall see him, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/130?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">D&amp;C 130:1</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477189\" id=\"p43\">Son of God <span class=\"key-word\">appeared</span>, declaring liberty, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/138?lang=eng&amp;id=p18#p18\">D&amp;C 138:18</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-pet/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p18-p19#p18\">1 Pet. 3:18–19</a>).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477191\" id=\"p44\">I saw two <span class=\"key-word\">Personages</span>, whose brightness and glory defy all description, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/js-h/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p17#p17\">JS—H 1:17</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128477193\" id=\"title3\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rev/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p17#p17\">Rev. 1:17</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rev/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p20#p20\">3:20</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rev/19?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">19:10</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/11?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\">3 Ne. 11:12</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/12?lang=eng&amp;id=p8#p8\">12:8</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/17?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">17:4</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</div>",
